    },
    {
      "id": 15064,
      "start": 178.16,
      "end": 179.76,
      "text": "有很多助理在那裡",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15065,
      "start": 179.76,
      "end": 181.76,
      "text": "是否他們幫你 或是你自己做的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15066,
      "start": 181.76,
      "end": 183.76,
      "text": "通常的素材是我放上去的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15067,
      "start": 183.76,
      "end": 185.76,
      "text": "素材是我自己想的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15068,
      "start": 185.76,
      "end": 187.76,
      "text": "很少人會幫我",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15069,
      "start": 187.76,
      "end": 189.36,
      "text": "因為想完之後未必是你的東西",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15070,
      "start": 189.36,
      "end": 193.2,
      "text": "為何等到今時今日才可以開這個Facebook的項目",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15071,
      "start": 193.2,
      "end": 195.36,
      "text": "這個世界上有些人反應很快",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15072,
      "start": 195.36,
      "end": 196.84,
      "text": "有些人反應很慢",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15073,
      "start": 196.84,
      "end": 198.84,
      "text": "我就屬於最慢的那一種",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15074,
      "start": 198.84,
      "end": 200.84,
      "text": "我今天代到第一句金句",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15075,
      "start": 200.84,
      "end": 202.68,
      "text": "很開心",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15076,
      "start": 202.68,
      "end": 205.24,
      "text": "現在這個人對音樂",
