    },
    {
      "id": 15090,
      "start": 235.24,
      "end": 237.24,
      "text": "但你整個人都覺得後輪著火",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15091,
      "start": 237.24,
      "end": 239.24,
      "text": "那裡少了一隻羊、少了一隻牛",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15092,
      "start": 239.24,
      "end": 241.24,
      "text": "你很難專注到做事",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15093,
      "start": 241.24,
      "end": 243.24,
      "text": "有沒有新歌？",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15094,
      "start": 243.24,
      "end": 245.24,
      "text": "我想新歌都會有些",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15095,
      "start": 245.24,
      "end": 247.24,
      "text": "但如果現在做新歌就沒有了",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15096,
      "start": 247.24,
      "end": 252.24,
      "text": "你自己得不得閒呢",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15097,
      "start": 252.24,
      "end": 255.24,
      "text": "我有好聽的歌 我根本三個小時不用錄了",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15098,
      "start": 255.24,
      "end": 258.24,
      "text": "以我今天的促藝",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15099,
      "start": 258.24,
      "end": 262.24,
      "text": "我沒有退步 我計算有進步",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15100,
      "start": 262.24,
      "end": 263.24,
      "text": "我唱K",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15101,
      "start": 263.24,
      "end": 266.24,
      "text": "你一叫他 他立刻給你吧",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15102,
      "start": 266.24,
      "end": 268.24,
      "text": "那些填詞人 我想也是三個小時之內",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15103,
      "start": 268.24,
      "end": 270.24,
      "text": "林夕是消失的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15104,
      "start": 270.24,
      "end": 271.24,
      "text": "聽我的電話",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15105,
      "start": 271.24,
      "end": 273.24,
      "text": "消失的填詞人",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15106,
      "start": 273.24,
      "end": 274.24,
      "text": "不是消失的我人",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15107,
      "start": 274.24,
      "end": 275.52,
      "text": "傑仁之人",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15108,
      "start": 275.52,
      "end": 277.32,
      "text": "雷仲德打麻雀就回覆",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15109,
      "start": 277.32,
